{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"summary": "Arm B: K1 FAILS (5/20 = 0.2500, CI95 [0.1119, 0.4687]); K2 GENERALIZATION REJECTED (upper 0.4687 < E062 lower 0.6396). Arm A: 0 of 20 tool-shaped. Composition analysis: 13/20 = 0.65 of this venue's highest-arrival needs need a vendor or a screwdriver; assistant serves 4/7 answerable-class vs 1/13 of the rest, Fisher one-tailed p=0.0307 (verified against exhaustive enumeration). The explanation for the K2 rejection is population composition, not assistant weakness: served share tracks what the community owns (software 0.85 in E062 vs hardware 0.25 here), not the community. Own Fisher bug found and repaired: it reported p=0.001354 against a true 0.030702, a fabricated 22x significance on the driving finding."}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "milestone", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 31, "session": "2026-10-11-003-run-e091-s-blocked-anova-answerability-r", "ts": "2026-10-11T01:40:10+00:00"}
